      "text": "Sec. 11-1405. Required equipment on motorcycles."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Any motorcycle carrying a passenger, other than in a sidecar or enclosed cab, shall be equipped with footrests for such passenger."
    },
    {
      "type": "source",
      "text": "(Source: P.A. 84-602.)"
